License, version 3 only, and so are licensed under the GNU General Public
License, version 3 only, as their SPDX-License-Identifier headers say. The
full text is in ../licenses/GPL-3.0.txt.

dnp3c itself is not in this repository: the build of the runner's image
fetches io.stepfunc:dnp3c from Maven Central. See ../THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md.
